  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 13.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf man ǽnig líc of rihtscriftscire elles hwær lecge, gelæste man þone sawlsceat swa þeah into þam mynstre þe hit to hyrde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a body is buried elsewhere than in the parish to which it properly belongs, the payment shall nevertheless be made to the church to which the deceased belonged.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf man ǽnig líc of rihtscriftscire elles hwær lecge, gelæste man þone sawlsceat swa þeah into þam mynstre, þe hit to hyrde.</ab>
      </div>
